# Every change requires a review from the repository owner.
#
# Combined with `require_code_owner_review` on the branch rulesets, this makes
# the owner's approval mandatory: without it, an approval from any collaborator
# would satisfy the review requirement, so two contributors could approve each
# other and merge without the owner ever seeing the change.
#
# GitHub reads CODEOWNERS from the base branch of a pull request, so this file
# has to exist on both `develop` and `main` to cover both directions.

